# Timestamped copies left by install.sh and by anyone editing a live file.
*.bak.*
*.orig
*.rej

# Your registry of what your skills need. The template requires.example.json
# is committed; the real one names this machine's skills and variables.
requires.json

# Python bytecode, left when a test imports lib/wire.py.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Session memory written by assistant tooling. Local, and none of a public
# repository's business.
.memsearch/
.ai-context/
.claude/
.codex/
CLAUDE.local.md

# The assistant's working notes, as in the other repositories of this author:
# instruction files, kb notes and audit work orders stay on the machine.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
kb/
review-*.md

# Editors and OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
